WEBVTT

00:00:16.630 --> 00:00:18.430
So, how long is this gonna take?

00:00:18.510 --> 00:00:20.590
You can't rush art.

00:00:23.470 --> 00:00:24.790
(MOOING)

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:27.390
(WHEELS SQUEAKING)

00:00:36.350 --> 00:00:38.470
SLINKY: Oh, no. It's closed.

00:00:38.590 --> 00:00:41.670
We're not preschool toys, Slinky.
We can read.

00:00:46.510 --> 00:00:48.590
-(DOORS MOOING)
-MAN: Hey, Joe, you're late.

00:00:48.670 --> 00:00:49.670
We've got a ton of toys to unload.

00:00:49.750 --> 00:00:52.150
All right. All right.
I'm comin'. I'm comin'.

00:00:52.750 --> 00:00:54.310
All right. Let's go.

00:00:54.390 --> 00:00:55.710
REX: But the sign says it's closed.

00:01:01.070 --> 00:01:03.030
No, no, no, no. All together. Now!

00:01:03.110 --> 00:01:05.590
-(ALL GRUNTING)
-(DOORS MOOING)

00:01:13.870 --> 00:01:14.870
(GIGGLING)

00:01:24.150 --> 00:01:27.190
Whoa, Nelly! How are we going
to find Woody in this place?

00:01:27.270 --> 00:01:31.070
Look for Al. We find Al,
we find Woody. Now move out!

00:01:32.310 --> 00:01:34.590
-Woody?
-Woody.

00:01:54.390 --> 00:01:55.670
(MOTOR PUMPING)

00:02:00.950 --> 00:02:02.150
(AIR HISSING)

00:02:42.750 --> 00:02:45.990
There you go. (CHUCKLES)

00:02:47.030 --> 00:02:49.190
He's for display only.

00:02:49.270 --> 00:02:51.750
You handle him too much,
he's not gonna last.

00:02:51.830 --> 00:02:54.750
It's amazing. You're a genius.
He's just like new.

00:03:02.630 --> 00:03:03.630
(GASPS)

00:03:17.150 --> 00:03:18.510
Wow.

00:03:28.030 --> 00:03:28.710
(GASPS)

00:03:32.150 --> 00:03:34.190
(WHISTLES) I could use one of those.

00:03:47.110 --> 00:03:50.430
You know, they make it so you can't
defeat Zurg unless you buy this book.

00:03:50.510 --> 00:03:52.550
It's extortion. That's what it is.

00:03:52.630 --> 00:03:55.590
Hey, I always thought
the golden sector was the only...

00:03:55.670 --> 00:03:56.990
(SCREAMS)

00:03:57.070 --> 00:03:58.710
HAMM: I thought
we could search in style.

00:03:58.950 --> 00:04:03.270
Nice going there, Hamm. So how about
letting a toy with fingers drive?

00:04:13.670 --> 00:04:15.510
Am I really that fat?

00:04:17.870 --> 00:04:18.870
(WHISTLES)

00:04:21.750 --> 00:04:22.790
-(GRUNTING)
-Ow!

00:04:22.870 --> 00:04:24.550
-What are you doing?
-You're in direct violation

00:04:24.630 --> 00:04:26.870
of Code 6404.5,

00:04:26.950 --> 00:04:29.510
stating all Space Rangers
are to be in hyper-sleep

00:04:29.590 --> 00:04:31.430
until awakened
by authorized personnel.

00:04:31.510 --> 00:04:33.030
-Oh, no.
-(GRUNTS)

00:04:33.510 --> 00:04:35.070
You're breakin' ranks, Ranger.

00:04:36.070 --> 00:04:37.670
Buzz Lightyear to Star Command.

00:04:37.750 --> 00:04:41.510
-I've got an AWOL Space Ranger.
-Tell me I wasn't this deluded.

00:04:41.590 --> 00:04:44.830
No back talk!
I have a laser, and I will use it.

00:04:44.910 --> 00:04:46.950
-Mean the laser that's a light bulb?
-(LASER HUMMING)

00:04:47.030 --> 00:04:48.070
(GASPS)

00:04:49.030 --> 00:04:52.630
Has your mind been melded?
You could've killed me, Space Ranger.

00:04:52.710 --> 00:04:55.150
Or should I say "traitor"?

00:04:56.110 --> 00:04:57.950
-I don't have time for this.
-Halt!

00:04:58.030 --> 00:04:59.390
I order you to halt!

00:05:01.630 --> 00:05:02.950
(BOTH GRUNTING)

00:05:06.430 --> 00:05:07.990
Listen to me. Listen. Wait.

00:05:10.430 --> 00:05:13.150
-We've been down this aisle already.
-We've never been down this aisle.

00:05:13.230 --> 00:05:15.310
-It's pink.
-Face it. We're lost.

00:05:15.390 --> 00:05:18.630
-HAMM: Back it up. Back it up.
-(ALL GIGGLING)

00:05:18.710 --> 00:05:20.030
(BEACH MUSIC PLAYS)

00:05:21.670 --> 00:05:23.430
What a great party!

00:05:24.630 --> 00:05:28.270
How low can you go?
How low can you go?

00:05:28.350 --> 00:05:29.590
(GIGGLING CONTINUES)

00:05:30.390 --> 00:05:31.590
Excuse me, ladies.

00:05:31.670 --> 00:05:34.670
Does anyone know where we might
find the Al of Al's Toy Barn?

00:05:34.750 --> 00:05:36.110
I can help.

00:05:38.430 --> 00:05:40.070
I'm Tour Guide Barbie.

00:05:40.150 --> 00:05:43.310
Please keep your hands, arms
and accessories inside the car,

00:05:43.390 --> 00:05:45.110
and no flash photography.

00:05:45.230 --> 00:05:47.550
-Thank you.
-I'm a married spud.

00:05:47.630 --> 00:05:50.590
-I'm a married spud.
-Then make room for the single fellas.

00:05:51.550 --> 00:05:54.630
BARBIE: To our right is the Hot Wheels
aisle. Developed in 1967,

00:05:54.710 --> 00:05:57.190
the original series had 16 cars,
including the Corvette.

00:05:57.270 --> 00:05:59.430
I beg your pardon, ma'am,
but where's Al's office?

00:05:59.510 --> 00:06:02.590
Please hold all questions
until the end of the tour. Thank you.

00:06:02.710 --> 00:06:05.110
It says how you defeat Zurg! Look!

00:06:05.190 --> 00:06:07.870
-Excuse me, sir.
-Get this outta here, geekosaur.

00:06:08.030 --> 00:06:10.230
-SLINKY: Look out!
-Stop, stop, stop!

